/japan-warehouse-forklift-crates_s.webp" alt="Boards staged in warehouse" loading="lazy" width="570" height="760"><figcaption><span class="photo-caption">Boards staged in warehouse</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></figcaption></a></figure><figure><a href="img/japan-warehouse-export-crates.webp" class="photo-link" data-en="Packaged boards" data-zh="已包装板材" data-group="warehouse"><img src="img/japan-warehouse-export-crates_s.webp" alt="Packaged boards" loading="lazy" width="570" height="760"><figcaption><span class="photo-caption">Packaged boards</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></figcaption></a></figure><figure><a href="img/japan-warehouse-panels-upright.webp" class="photo-link" data-en="Panels stored upright" data-zh="立放板材" data-group="warehouse"><img src="img/japan-warehouse-panels-upright_s.webp" alt="Panels stored upright" loading="lazy" width="570" height="760"><figcaption><span class="photo-caption">Panels stored upright</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></figcaption></a></figure><figure><a href="img/japan-warehouse-yard.webp" class="photo-link" data-en="Warehouse yard" data-zh="仓库外场" data-group="warehouse"><img src="img/japan-warehouse-yard_s.webp" alt="Warehouse yard" loading="lazy" width="570" height="760"><figcaption><span class="photo-caption">Warehouse yard</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></figcaption></a></figure></div></div></section></div></main><footer class="media-footer"><div class="media-shell"><a href="index.html">EST.</a><span data-t="rights">© EST Co., Ltd. All rights reserved.</span></div></footer>
